\par\par \b \uc2  US/HK forwards end sharply lower as HK$ sales drop. \b0\par\par\uc2 373 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 August 1998\par 11:20\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par \tab \tab   Close\tab     Open\tab \tab Previous Close\par   HK$ SPOT    7.7465/75\tab 7.7465/75\tab  7.7495/05\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  FORWARDS \par \par \uc2    3-Month     1,025-1,075    1,100-1,200     1,400-1,500 \par \par \uc2    6-Month     2,100-2,300    2,200-2,300     2,500-2,900 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par   1-Year\tab 4,500-4,800    4,400-4,600     5,300-5,600\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par INTERBANK RATE (IN PERCENTAGE)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par   Overnight   7.00-8.00\tab 7.00-8.00\tab  7.25-8.12\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par   3-Month     10.60-11.12    11.00-11.50     12.50-13.00\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par   6-Month     11.10-12.00    11.00-11.50     12.50-13.10\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par   1-Year\tab 11.70-12.60    11.75-12.25     13.00-13.60.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     HONG KONG, Aug 10 (Reuters) - US/HK forwards fell sharply by\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Monday's close as attacks on the Hong Kong dollar faded after\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par vigorous short selling last week.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     "There is no sign of a major speculative attack against the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Hong Kong dollar today," a dealer said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Market sentiment improved as expected attacks on the Hong\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Kong dollar over weekend did not materialise, dealers said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Continuous offers by major local banks and note-issuing\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par banks in the forward market weighed on local interbank rates,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par while a steep yield curve limited buying interest, they said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     "The Hong Kong \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  was heard offering short\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par term money into the interbank market, helping to steepen the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par yield curve," a bank treasurer said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     But few believed the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  war was over.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     "Though the market sentiment moderately improved today, most\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par of us remained cautious, because the war is not yet over, "\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par another dealer said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Dealers said the underlying tone was weak, amid a weaker\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Japanese yen above 146 per dollar as well as lingering concern\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par over a possible devaluation of the Chinese yuan.\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 China\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on Monday to hold the yuan\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par at the 8.28 level. The black market rate for the Chinese yuan\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par spiked above nine yuan per dollar in earlier trade.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Dealers said while further downside for local interbank\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par rates was possible, the benchmark three-month HIBOR was likely\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par to find support at nine percent.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -Angi Li (852) 2847 4039; Fax 2845 0636.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (C) Reuters Limited 1998.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021113du8a02s7o\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
