\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 China \highlight\uc2  yuan little changed as cen bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 338 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 31 Juli 1998\par 07:04\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SHANGHAI, July 31 (Reuters) - The Chinese yuan closed nearly unchanged against the U.S. dollar in Shanghai on Friday after the People's Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the local unit, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was seen buying the yuan at the key 8.2800 level after the local unit came under downward pressure due to falls in the Japanese yen on world \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets earlier on Friday, they said. \par \par \uc2  The yuan ended at 8.2799 to one dollar on Friday against Thursday's close of 8.2800. \par \par \uc2  "The yuan faced fresh pressure on Friday due to renewed falls in the yen," a dealer said. "This triggered \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the local unit." \par \par \uc2  The pressure on the yen eased by midday as the U.S. dollar had drifted lower in Tokyo on profit-taking. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was at 143.47/57 yen around midday from a high of 143.85 yen earlier and 143.68/73 yen in late New York trading on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the yuan indicated Beijing would stand behind its pledge not to devalue the local unit at least in the short term. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said they expected the yuan to move narrowly around the 8.2800 level early next week as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was expected to continue to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  if needed. \par \par \uc2  The yuan opened at 8.2799 on Friday and moved in a narrow range between the intraday high of 8.2798 and intraday low of 8.2800. \par \par \uc2  Trading was dull with most business done at 8.2799. \par \par \uc2  The yuan closed up against the Japanese yen at 5.7700 to 100 yen from 5.8250. It ended little changed against the Hong Kong dollar at 1.0680 to one dollar from 1.0681. \par \par \uc2     - Shanghai Newsroom: (86) 21-6355-4009; Fax 21-6355-5015 \par \par \uc2      - Email: reutersh@uninet.com.cn \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021113du7v0312a\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
