\par\par \b \uc2  Buba Jochimsen/ \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2 /Clinton -2: " \highlight22\uc2 China \highlight\uc2  On Review" \b0\par\par\uc2 197 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 Juni 1998\par 13:18\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BONN (Dow Jones)--Deutsche Bundesbank council member Reimut Jochimsen said Friday that Wednesday's concerted U.S.-Japan \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to bolster the yen should be seen in the context of U.S. President Bill Clinton's upcoming visit to China. \par \par \uc2  "The most recent American activities (in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market) must be seen in the context of Clinton's visit to China," Jochimsen said on the sidelines of an event commemorating the 50th anniversary of the Deutsche mark. \par \par \uc2  Clinton will visit China between June 25 and July 3. \par \par \uc2  There has been widespread speculation that the Chinese monetary authorities will eventually have to devalue the yuan, but so far they have maintained their strategy of defending their \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Because a further depreciation of the yen would further hurt Chinese exports, this is seen as another reason for the U.S. to halt the yen's decline. \par \par \uc2  Separately, Jochimsen noted he's optimistic that Japan is serious about reform. \par \par \uc2  He also said that capital flight from Asia has helped the German stock market. \par \par \uc2  Jochimsen also heads the regional \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  headquartered in Duesseldorf. \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 19-06-98 \par \par \uc2  1118GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du6j056ux\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
