\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 China \highlight\uc2  Yuan Ends Unchanged; No Reaction To Yen  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 251 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Juni 1998\par 09:03\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  N/EWR N/BKG N/FXW N/MRP \par \par \uc2  SHANGHAI (Dow Jones)--China's yuan ended unchanged against the U.S. dollar Thursday in stable trade, showing no reaction to the recovery of the Japanese yen against the U.S. dollar, which has pulled other regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  higher, traders said. \par \par \uc2  "The market didn't react to news that the U.S. and Japan \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  (Wednesday) in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to prop up the yen," said one market trader. \par \par \uc2  At the Shanghai-based China \b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign Exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  Trading Center, the dollar closed unchanged at CNY8.2799. It traded in a range of CNY8.2796 and CNY8.2800. China's yuan is tradable under the current account only, or for trade-related purposes, which has protected it from speculative attack. \par \par \uc2  Traders said that demand Thursday for both the yuan and the U.S. dollar was more balanced that in recent sessions, which allowed the People's Bank of China, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , to reduce its tight hold over the market. \par \par \uc2  Earlier in the week, the PBoC was seen actively supporting the yuan with new, tighter trading limits that left the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  virtually unchanged for several trading sessions. It was also selling dollars, tapping into its warchest of $140 billion in reserves, traders said. That presence, traders said, helped reassure participants that the yuan would remain stable, and led to a falloff in demand for the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 18-06-98 \par \par \uc2  0703GMT \par \par \uc2  1153 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du6i05bh4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
