\par\par \b \uc2  Dollar Barely Up Vs Yen In Volatile Australasian Trading \b0\par\par\uc2 297 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Juni 1998\par 01:30\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    WELLINGTON (Dow Jones)--The dollar is mixed in\par nervous and volatile Australasian dealing Thursday but\par against the yen is still trading not too far from its late\par Wednesday New York levels.\par    The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market is cautious about the possibility of\par further Bank of Japan \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to sell dollars against\par the yen when Tokyo trading commences, although no \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central\par bank intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has been reported in the Australasian\par session, traders said.\par    But the market is awash with rumors of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , with potential candidates including the\par People's Bank of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 China\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par    The dollar fell by five and half yen Wednesday as the\par U.S. Federal Reserve joined the Japanese \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to\par support the yen.\par    Around 2315 GMT Wednesday (11.15 a.m. local time\par Thursday) the dollar is quoted at Y136.77, up from its\par Y136.64 late Wednesday level in New York. The U.S. \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par is also changing hands at DEM1.7835, down from DEM1.7870\par late Wednesday in New York.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Sterling is trading at $1.6683,\par compared with $1.6690 late Wednesday in New York.\par    So far since the close of New York trading the dollar\par has traded ranges of Y136.35 to Y137.15 and DEM1.7815 to\par DEM1.7870.\par    "If there is further \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  (to support the yen),\par the dollar could test Y135.00 where there are big stop/loss\par orders. And if that level breaks the dollar could easily go\par to Y133.00," said a Wellington-based \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  trader.\par    "Dollar/yen is very whippy and moving by 10 pips each\par quote," he said.\par    Traders said that the possibility of further\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to sell the dollar made it difficult to\par forecast ranges.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires  06-17-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1930EDT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1074 1863 4162 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020010916du6h01jrn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
