\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 China \highlight\uc2  yuan ends unchanged on c.bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 355 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Juni 1998\par 05:30\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SHANGHAI, June 16 (Reuters) - The Chinese yuan closed unchanged at 8.2798 against the U.S. dollar on Tuesday after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was seen buying the yuan at the key 8.2800 level, indicating its determination to defend the yuan at least for the time being, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The local unit moved narrowly between 8.2798 and 8.2800 during the whole session. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  helped the yuan to stabilise today despite fresh pressure for the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to fall," a dealer said. \par \par \uc2  "It indicated the central government's determination not to allow the yuan to depreciate at least for the time being." \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials were not immediately available for comments on the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the Shanghai-based market, the \b \highlight22\uc2 China Foreign Exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  Trade System, does not post trading volumes. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said foreign investment figures released by official media on Tuesday also exerted pressure on the yuan. \par \par \uc2  The Shenzhen-based Securities Times reported foreign direct investment to China fell 1.49 percent year-on-year in the first five months of 1998 to $14.885 bilion. \par \par \uc2  "In addition to the weakening Japanese yen, some economic data seems to run against yuan stability," a second dealer said. \par \par \uc2  "If there was no \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the yuan would have long ago fallen below the key (8.2800) level," he said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers believed the yuan would continue to move narrowly around current levels in the short term as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would help sentiment to the yuan. \par \par \uc2  The yuan opened at 8.2798 on Tuesday. Trading was slow with most business done at 8.2798, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The weighted average price on Monday was 8.2799. \par \par \uc2  The yuan closed down against Japanese yen at 5.7415 to 100 yen from 5.6936. \par \par \uc2  It ended up against the Hong Kong dollar at an intraday high of 1.0695 to one dollar from 1.0707. \par \par \uc2  - Shanghai Newsroom: (86) 21-6355-4009; Fax 21-6355-5015 \par \par \uc2  - Email: reutersh@uninet.com.cn. \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010925du6g02th2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
