\par\par \b \uc2  China Yuan Ends Down, But Traders Say Still Well-Supported \b0\par\par\uc2 231 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Juni 1998\par 06:41\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SHANGHAI (Dow Jones)--China's yuan finished a touch lower against the U.S. dollar Thursday, edging close to a key support level at CNY8.2800 for the semi-convertible yuan, even though demand for the two \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  remained in balance, traders said. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the People's Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2 , was watching the market closely and may have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  slightly, as it has been doing almost daily since the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was opened up for current-account transactions in 1994. \par \par \uc2  But the participants also noted that the yuan continues to be well-supported by healthy capital inflows and the near-complete absence of speculative forces that operate in freely traded \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets. \par \par \uc2  At the Shanghai-based China \b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign Exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  Trading Center, the dollar closed at CNY8.2796, off a touch from the previous day's CNY8.2793. It traded between CNY8.2795 and CNY8.2799. \par \par \uc2  China's yuan is convertible under the current account only, or for trade in goods and services. That has left the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  immune from the type of large-scale capital movements that have rocked regional markets over the past year. In fact, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders say many large-scale transactions on the yuan market are pre-arranged by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and state-owned banks. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 11-06-98 \par \par \uc2  0441GMT \par \par \uc2  1153 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du6b050hv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
