\par\par \b \uc2  Hong Kong shares extend losses in London trade. \b0\par\par\uc2      By Louise Ireland \par \uc2 417 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Juni 1998\par 17:03\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2     LONDON, June 10 (Reuters) - Hong Kong stocks extended in \par \par \uc2  London large losses seen in the home market on Wednesday amid \par \par \uc2  mounting anxiety over the effects of a weakening Japanese yen. \par \par \uc2     A fresh rout on the Hong Kong bourse sent the Hang Seng index \par \par \uc2  to a three-year low with a five percent loss, while London's \par \par \uc2  Hang Seng London Reference Index of leading stocks traded here \par \par \uc2  shed a further 51.31 points or 0.6 percent to 7,928.06. \par \par \uc2  The yen remained under pressure at more than 141 to the \par \par \uc2  dollar but recovered from seven-year lows amid speculation of \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the beleagued \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Renewed worries that \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2  may devalue the yuan added to \par \par \uc2  market nervousness, dealers said. China's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  issued on \par \par \uc2  Tuesday its most severe warning yet over the impact on the \par \par \uc2  Chinese economy of a tumbling yen. \par \par \uc2  "There is obviously pressure for devaluation on the Chinese \par \par \uc2  authorities. And, if they did it, it would put an awful lot of \par \par \uc2  pressure on Hong Kong, which hasn't devalued whereas most of the \par \par \uc2  rest of Asia has," said Credit Suisse First Boston strategist \par \par \uc2  Steve Wright. \par \par \uc2  "That would hit asset prices and be pretty destabilising. \par \par \uc2  Not only that, but a lot of companies have dollar-denominated \par \par \uc2  debts. It would unsettle the whole region," said CSFB's Wright. \par \par \uc2  Such concerns sent Hong Kong interest rates rocketing and \par \par \uc2  the benchmark HIBOR three-month rate rose nearly half a point \par \par \uc2  from the same time on Tuesday as pressure mounted on the HK$/$ \par \par \uc2  peg. \par \par \uc2  And as concerns spread through the region, Taiwan's \b \highlight22\uc2 central \b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2  bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  called an emergency board meeting to discuss its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  as the Taiwanese dollar fell through a key support level. \par \par \uc2  Among leading Hong Kong shares, HSBC Holdings was trading \par \par \uc2  HK$1.75 down at HK$180.225 from its Hong Kong close, while among \par \par \uc2  other Asia-linked British shares Standard Chartered traded 22p \par \par \uc2  or 3.1 percent down at 692p and Cable & Wireless shed 15p or 2.1 \par \par \uc2  percent or 16p to 710. \par \par \uc2  Markets were also unsettled ahead of Wednesday's testimony \par \par \uc2  from Federal Reserve chairman Alan Greenspan, to be closely \par \par \uc2  scrutinised for any indication on the direction of U.S. interest \par \par \uc2  rates. Any hint of a U.S. rate rise would add to pressure on the \par \par \uc2  yen, so Greenspan was expected to be even more careful than \par \par \uc2  usual to tread a particularly cautious line, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010925du6a034sd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
