\par\par \b \uc2  China Yuan/Ends -2: Other  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2  Mixed; NDF Rates Up \b0\par\par\uc2 302 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Mai 1998\par 10:55\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Despite talk of a yuan depreciation for competitive reasons, large \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves and strong \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  inflows - most of which must be converted in to yuan on arrival in the country - keep the Chinese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  fundamentally strong. Before the unhinging of other Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2 's PBoC often \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in yuan trading to keep the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from appreciating against the dollar. \par \par \uc2  More recently, a shift in government focus to domestic-led from export-led growth means that China must maintain a powerful yuan in order to keep import costs low and to preserve the value of bank savings and deposits which are needed to fund development projects. \par \par \uc2  In other trading Friday, the Hong Kong dollar closed at CNY1.0694, up from Thursday's CNY1.0693 while the Japanese yen ended at CNY6.1801 per 100 yen, down from the previous close of CNY6.1921. \par \par \uc2  In the non-deliverable forward market, which gives an indication of how participants expect the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to trade in the coming few months, money broker Exco Group in Singapore on Friday was quoting the U.S. dollar at CNY8.6586 for delivery in six months and at CNY9.0286 over a one-year timeframe. \par \par \uc2  The rise in the 12-month figure to over CNY9.00 indicates an ongoing belief by \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders that China will sometime be forced to reduce the value of the yuan, market traders said. \par \par \uc2  As well as being only semi-convertible, the yuan is controlled by tight trading margins for the yuan, both with official price limits for the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and a strong trading presence by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stabilize even slight fluctuations. \par \par \uc2  -By Catherine McKinley; (8621)6279-7294; cmckinley@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 15-05-98 \par \par \uc2  0855GMT \par \par \uc2  1153 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du5f044lu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
