 will sometime be forced to reduce the value of the yuan, market traders said. \par \par \uc2  As well as being only semi-convertible, the yuan is controlled by tight trading margins for the yuan, both with official price limits for the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and a strong trading presence by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stabilize even slight fluctuations. \par \par \uc2  -By Catherine McKinley; (8621)6279-7294; cmckinley@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires  15-05-98 \par \par \uc2  0855GMT \par \par \uc2  1153 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020010917du5f004xc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
